return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-14T12:27:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-14T12:27:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it.'=>'Wadahadal toos ah oo degdeg ah oo ilaaliya asturnaanta oo loogu talagalay mareegahaaga. Wuxuu ku jawaabaa booqdayaasha AI marka aad mashquulsan tahay, wuxuu kuugu dhiibaa marka ay u baahan yihiin qof, wuxuuna kuu soo diraa emayl wax kasta oo kaaga baxa bogga. Wax ka yar 10 KB oo bogga ah mana jiraan wax codsiyo ah haba yaraatee ilaa qof ka furo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Settings'=>'Dejinta','That does not look like a Zinn® Chat key. Copy it from the Live chat page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard — it starts with zc_.'=>'Taasi uma ekaato fure Zinn® Chat. Ka soo guuri bogga Live chat ee sabuuraddaada kontoroolka ee Zinn Digital® — wuxuu ka billowdaa zc_.','Add your chat key before switching the chat on — without it there is nothing for the widget to connect to.'=>'Ku dar furahaaga sheekada ka hor inta aanad shidin sheekada — adiga oo aan lahayn ma jiro wax ay agabku ku xirmaan.','Live chat for this site. Visitors get an answer straight away, you get anything you miss by email, and the whole thing is under 10 KB on the page.'=>'Wadahadal toos ah oo loogu talagalay boggan. Booqadayaashu waxay helayaan jawaab isla markiiba, waxaad email ku heleysaa wax kasta oo ku dhaafa, wax walbana waa ka yar yihiin 10 KB bogga dushiisa.','The chat is live on this site.'=>'Wadahadalku wuxuu ka toosan yahay boggan.','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'Wadahadalku waa dansan yahay. Waxba lagama soo raray boggaaga.','Chat key'=>'Furaha sheekada','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'Ka koobiy tan bogga sheekaysiga tooska ah ee %sadaada.','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Golaha maamulka ee Zinn Digital®','Show the chat'=>'Muuji sheekada','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'U muuji daaqadda wadahadalka booqashada boggan','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'Ilaa aad tan saxeyso, furaha (plugin) waxba kuma daro baxyadaada — ma jiro qoraal barnaamijyeed (script), ma jiro buskud (cookie), ma jiraan codsiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting for WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, gurmadyada maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga xakamaynta ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibsii oo iibi mareegaha la aas-aasay, agabyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyeyaasha, adoo lacagta si ammaan ah u haya ilaa labada dhinac ay ka farxayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee xorta ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey waa ay ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka daacadnimadeeda mana aan lagu rakibin.','Everything here keeps working for nothing, for ever. Pro is for when one person answering, and a month of history, stops being enough.'=>'Wax walba oo halkan yaalla waxay sii wadaan inay si bilaash ah u shaqeeyaan, weligood. Pro waa marka hal qof oo soo jawaabaya, iyo hal bil oo taariikh ah, ay ka dhamaadaan inay ku filnaadaan.','As many colleagues answering at once as you like — the free plugin allows one.'=>'Intii aad doonto ee asxaab ah hal mar hal mar ha uga jawaabeen — furaha bilaashka ah wuxuu oggolaadaa hal.','Every conversation kept for ever, instead of thirty days.'=>'Wada-hadal kasta waxaa loo hayaa weligeed, halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd soddon maalmood.','Your own name on the chat window, with ours removed.'=>'Magacaaga oo ku yaal daaqada sheekaysiga, adigoo ka saaray kayaga.','Saved replies, transfer a conversation to a colleague, and business hours.'=>'Jawaabaha la kaydiyay, u wareejinta wadahadalka asxaabta, iyo saacadaha shaqada.','5,000 AI answers a month rather than 100.'=>'5,000 oo jawaabood oo AI ah bishii halkii ay ka noqon lahayd 100.','Choose exactly which pages the chat appears on — or hide it from the checkout.'=>'Dooro bogocyada sax ah ee ay wada-sheekaysintu ka muuqato — ama ka qari bixinta lacagta.','One licence covers three of your sites; ten-site licences are available.'=>'Hal ruqsad wuxuu daboolayaa saddex ka mid ah mareegahaaga; ruqsadaha toban mareegood ayaa la heli karaa.','See what Pro costs'=>'Arag waxa uu Pro ku kacayo','Already host a site with Zinn Digital®? Pro is included free — your key is on the %s.'=>'Horay ma u leedahay bog ku yaal Zinn Digital®? Pro waxaa lagu daray lacag la\'aan — furahaagu wuxuu ku yaal %s.','Licences page of your dashboard'=>'Bogga liisamada ee dashboard-kaaga','Your licence is active.'=>'Sharcigaaga waa mid shaqeynaya.','Your licence has run out but everything still works for a short while. Renew it to keep receiving updates.'=>'Sannad-rugmadaadu waa ay dhacday laakiin wax walba waa ay sii shaqeynayaan muddo gaaban. Cusboonaysii si aad u sii waddo helitaanka wixii soo kordha.','We do not recognise that licence key. Copy it again from the Licences page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ma aqoonsanin furahaas liisamada. Mar laba soo guuri bogga Liisamada ee sabuuraddaada Zinn Digital®.','That key is for a different Zinn® plugin. The one you want is on the Licences page of your dashboard, next to Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Furahaas waxaa loogu talagalay darawal kale oo Zinn® ah. Midka aad rabto wuxuu ku yaallaa bogga Liisanka ee guddigaaga maamulka, oo ku xiga Zinn® Chat Pro.','Your licence has expired. Renew it from your Zinn Digital® dashboard to switch the Pro features back on.'=>'Shatigaagu waa dhacay. Ka cusboonaysii muraayadaada xakamaynta ee Zinn Digital® si aad u shido astaamaha Pro mar kale.','This licence has been cancelled.'=>'Ruqsatmadan waa la joojiyay.','This licence is on hold. Please get in touch and we will sort it out.'=>'Shatigani waa la haysaa. Fadlan nala soo xiriir waanu xallin doonaaye.','There is a billing problem on your Zinn Digital® account. Once it is settled the licence works again straight away.'=>'Waxaa jira dhibaato xisaabeed oo ka jirta koontadaada Zinn Digital®. Marka la xalliyo, liisamadu waxay dib u bilaaban doonaan isla markiiba.','This licence came free with your Zinn® hosting, and that hosting has ended. Buy a licence, or start hosting with us again, to switch Pro back on.'=>'Liisankani waxa uu ku yimid si bilaash ah martigelintaada Zinn® , martigelintaasina way dhamaatay. Iibso liisan, ama mar kale nagala bilow martigelinta, si aad Pro dib ugu shaqeyso.','Every site on this licence is in use. Release one below, or upgrade to cover more sites.'=>'Bog kasta oo ku jira shatigan waa la isticmaalayaa. Sii daayo mid hoose, ama kor u qaad si aad u daboosho bogag badan.','We could not confirm your licence just now. Nothing has changed on your site; we will try again shortly.'=>'Waqtigan xaadirka ah ma aan xaqiijin karin shatigaaga. Wax isbedel ah kama dhicin boggaaga; waxaan isku dayi doonaa mar kale dhawaan.','You do not have permission to manage licences on this site.'=>'Ma lihid ogolaansho aad ku maamusho shatiyada boggan.','Your Pro licence'=>'Sharcigaaga Pro','Licence key'=>'Furaha shatiga','Copy it from the Licences page of your %s.'=>'Ka koobi bogga Shatiyada ee %sada.','Renews on %s.'=>'Wuxuu cusbooneysiinayaa %s.','Using %1$d of %2$d sites.'=>'Waxaa la isticmaalayaa %1$d oo ah %2$d shabakadood.','In use on: %s. Release one from your dashboard, then try again.'=>'Waxaa isticmaalaya: %s. Sii daa mid ka mid ah guddigaaga maamulka, kadibna isku day mar kale.','Save licence'=>'Keydso shatiga','Remove it from this site'=>'Ka saar boggan','Where the chat appears'=>'Halka uu wada-sheekaysigu ka muuqdo','Show it'=>'Muuji','Everywhere on this site'=>'Meelkasta oo ka tirsan boggan','Only on the pages I choose below'=>'Kaliya bogagga aan hoose ku doorto','Everywhere except the pages I choose below'=>'Meel kasta oo ka reeban bogagga aan hoose ku doorto','Page or post IDs'=>'Aqoonsiyada bogagga ama qoraallada','Separate them with commas. The ID is in the address bar while you edit a page.'=>'Kala saar iyaga oo isticmaalaya hakadyo. Aqoonsigu wuxuu ku jiraa barta cinwaanka inta aad wax ka beddelayso bog.','Whole content types'=>'Noocyada nuxurka oo dhan','Signed-in visitors'=>'Booqdayeyaasha soo galay','Hide the chat from people who are signed in to this site'=>'Ka qari wadasheekaysiga dadka ku soo galay degelkan','Save where it appears'=>'Keyd halka uu ka muuqdo']];